<title>BELGIUM: Kredietbank to merge HSA, Spaarkrediet.</title>
<headline>Kredietbank to merge HSA, Spaarkrediet.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian banks HSA and Spaarkrediet, two units of Kredietbank NV, will merge on April 22, the two banks said in a joint statement on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
